  "title": "Ham Pineapple Sandwiches",
  "description": "I found a recipe for Pineapple Sandwiches on white bread that was far too sweet. I put some ham on it, and put it on whole grain bread for a slightly healthier alternative that is not nearly so sweet!",
  "authors": [
